WEBVTT

01:40.770 --> 01:45.600
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.310 --> 01:50.840
[Episode 8]

01:51.850 --> 01:54.630
[Clairvoyant Yang Residence]

01:55.310 --> 01:57.280
Now that you won't give me an answer,

01:57.280 --> 01:58.070
I can only assume

01:58.070 --> 02:00.530
my uncle sent them to the Inspection Bureau.

02:00.560 --> 02:01.920
I'll go bring them back.

02:02.350 --> 02:03.040
Yitan,

02:04.510 --> 02:05.730
will you stop messing around?

02:05.730 --> 02:07.260
Who's messing around here?

02:07.400 --> 02:08.520
Young Master Wangquan told us

02:08.520 --> 02:09.710
to wait for his return.

02:09.710 --> 02:11.450
Yet you didn't stop Uncle from

02:11.520 --> 02:13.390
drugging us and taking them away!

02:13.590 --> 02:15.120
Luckily, Miss Qinlan

02:15.140 --> 02:16.990
woke me up shortly after.

02:17.100 --> 02:18.890
Zui is still asleep now.

02:20.480 --> 02:21.000
Huaizhu.

02:21.000 --> 02:22.030
What happened?

02:22.870 --> 02:24.190
They dosed Yitan and Zui

02:24.190 --> 02:25.870
with a potent sleeping drug.

02:26.000 --> 02:27.760
I fed Yitan the only one

02:27.870 --> 02:29.030
detoxing pill I had.

02:33.630 --> 02:34.750
Where are they?

02:39.079 --> 02:40.940
All I need is a quick look at him...

02:45.150 --> 02:45.960
Yan!

02:47.750 --> 02:48.360
Huaizhu...

02:48.360 --> 02:49.150
Auntie.

02:49.940 --> 02:51.320
Don't worry.

02:51.350 --> 02:52.880
Mu Xiaowu will be fine.

02:55.840 --> 02:56.990
They forbid

02:57.840 --> 02:59.560
anyone from going in

03:01.120 --> 03:02.820
until the interrogation is over.

03:02.820 --> 03:04.140
Yitan, Chu Jing,

03:05.030 --> 03:06.090
let's get in there.

03:17.590 --> 03:19.560
I demand to speak to Nangong Chui!

03:29.800 --> 03:30.640
Chu Jing,

03:31.120 --> 03:32.240
come near me.

03:34.000 --> 03:35.120
Tell me why

03:35.750 --> 03:37.120
you killed, loudly.

03:40.280 --> 03:43.240
Someone forced me to swallow a demon-controlling talisman

03:43.240 --> 03:44.710
in order to control me

03:44.750 --> 03:46.210
and make me kill in public.

03:47.840 --> 03:48.840
Is this person

03:49.120 --> 03:50.240
in presence?

03:51.910 --> 03:52.590
Yes.

03:52.840 --> 03:54.000
Point him out.

03:57.400 --> 03:58.280
It's him.

04:00.020 --> 04:00.740
Master.

04:00.870 --> 04:01.800
Master, help me!

04:01.840 --> 04:02.630
Master,

04:02.650 --> 04:04.240
I did it only at your request.

04:04.240 --> 04:05.360
Master, help me!

04:05.360 --> 04:07.630
-You asked me to do it, Master.
-What a liar.

04:07.630 --> 04:08.400
I just did your bidding!

04:08.400 --> 04:09.280
Get lost!

04:35.680 --> 04:37.040
Release Mu Xiaowu.

04:39.570 --> 04:40.490
Yan,

04:41.430 --> 04:43.430
Young Master Wangquan is here to help.

04:43.430 --> 04:45.030
Xiaowu will be set free soon.

05:59.560 --> 06:00.510
Huaizhu!

06:00.920 --> 06:01.950
Huaizhu!

06:29.570 --> 06:30.560
Auntie,

06:31.270 --> 06:32.390
the people inside

06:32.950 --> 06:34.430
tortured him brutally.

06:35.130 --> 06:36.690
He was already weak.

06:36.750 --> 06:38.280
Then he lost too much blood.

06:38.909 --> 06:40.710
His meridians were also broken.

06:42.360 --> 06:43.890
I'm afraid he is beyond cure

06:45.750 --> 06:47.950
even with the Divine Fire Villa's help.

07:02.070 --> 07:04.120
This can't be true. No.

07:04.120 --> 07:05.070
I don't believe it.

07:05.070 --> 07:06.510
Huaizhu, please help him!

07:06.510 --> 07:07.310
Huaizhu!

07:07.360 --> 07:08.160
Huaizhu!

07:09.950 --> 07:11.070
I'm sorry, Yan.

07:13.070 --> 07:13.510
T...

07:13.510 --> 07:14.910
There's nothing I can do.

07:16.390 --> 07:18.390
But I can feed him an Awakening Pill,

07:19.160 --> 07:20.600
so that he will come to

07:21.920 --> 07:23.120
and bid you farewell.

08:36.360 --> 08:37.120
Xiaowu.

08:37.909 --> 08:38.880
Xiaowu.

08:41.030 --> 08:41.840
Yan.

09:08.550 --> 09:09.240
Yan,

09:11.200 --> 09:13.030
I didn't betray the Yang family.

09:14.240 --> 09:16.250
The Yang family betrayed you.

09:17.840 --> 09:19.790
Don't say that.

09:20.150 --> 09:22.680
After all, they're your brothers and father.

09:25.400 --> 09:27.040
They didn't expect

09:27.120 --> 09:29.790
such cruelty from the Inspection Bureau.

09:38.590 --> 09:41.390
Don't hate them for this.

09:49.390 --> 09:50.280
Yan,

09:51.020 --> 09:52.710
after I'm gone,

09:54.500 --> 09:56.120
remember to eat properly.

09:57.390 --> 09:58.590
It's fine to be picky,

10:00.360 --> 10:01.890
but don't go to the extreme.

10:06.150 --> 10:08.240
I know you'll have a broken heart,

10:09.450 --> 10:11.650
but don't let it bother you for too long.

10:14.750 --> 10:16.070
Promise me

10:17.000 --> 10:18.840
you will move on.

10:21.360 --> 10:23.150
You have a long life

10:26.130 --> 10:28.010
ahead of you.

10:30.550 --> 10:31.030
No...

10:40.080 --> 10:41.510
After all these years

10:41.670 --> 10:43.200
of working in the mine,

10:44.320 --> 10:46.360
I've saved up 580 taels of silver.

10:47.910 --> 10:50.440
The notes are in your dressing-case.

10:52.120 --> 10:54.000
What a shame that it's too little

10:55.840 --> 10:58.510
to be considered a bride price for you.

11:01.240 --> 11:03.080
I planned to fill up the box

11:03.940 --> 11:06.420
before presenting it

11:07.240 --> 11:08.240
to you.

11:21.790 --> 11:22.670
Chu Jing...

11:31.440 --> 11:32.390
Chu Jing,

11:33.480 --> 11:34.700
it is not your fault

11:35.120 --> 11:36.240
that I'm dying.

11:37.550 --> 11:39.200
Don't beat yourself up.

11:41.790 --> 11:43.120
Chu Jing, you're a demon

11:44.060 --> 11:46.240
that has seen the sun.

11:47.030 --> 11:47.840
From now on,

11:49.870 --> 11:52.510
you must lead an honest life,

11:54.270 --> 11:55.630
and be a decent demon.

12:10.510 --> 12:12.300
I wish I could live longer.

12:14.400 --> 12:15.480
That way,

12:18.050 --> 12:21.190
my beloved woman won't be upset.

12:52.530 --> 12:54.980
♪ How can clouds stop for us? ♪

12:55.660 --> 12:59.210
♪ The vicissitudes of life never cease ♪

13:00.170 --> 13:04.650
♪ The time we spend together is too short and unreal ♪

13:05.950 --> 13:09.740
♪ You blur into a shadow near me ♪

13:10.980 --> 13:12.910
♪ We're fully committed ♪

13:13.450 --> 13:15.200
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

13:16.270 --> 13:20.090
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

13:20.620 --> 13:22.880
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

13:23.560 --> 13:25.660
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

13:26.830 --> 13:30.840
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

13:28.360 --> 13:29.030
Grandpa.

13:29.550 --> 13:30.270
Back off!

13:31.240 --> 13:32.100
Don't go there.

13:33.120 --> 13:37.480
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

13:34.360 --> 13:35.150
Yan!

13:38.200 --> 13:40.760
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

13:41.220 --> 13:43.180
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

13:43.950 --> 13:45.780
♪ Time goes by ♪

13:46.450 --> 13:48.340
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

13:49.170 --> 13:52.550
♪ But our love remains still ♪

13:54.130 --> 13:58.510
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

13:59.410 --> 14:01.800
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

13:59.550 --> 14:00.440
Yitan.

14:02.840 --> 14:04.490
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

14:03.840 --> 14:04.600
Yan,

14:05.040 --> 14:06.520
you're pregnant now.

14:05.110 --> 14:06.590
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

14:06.630 --> 14:08.000
Grief is bad for your health.

14:07.520 --> 14:09.260
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

14:09.030 --> 14:09.840
Go with Dad.

14:09.960 --> 14:13.550
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

14:10.240 --> 14:11.030
Go with you?

14:13.030 --> 14:13.910
Where to?

14:14.030 --> 14:14.510
You...

14:19.720 --> 14:21.510
To the Yang 's residence

14:22.440 --> 14:23.320
where my so-called family

14:23.320 --> 14:25.790
would heartlessly betray their next-of-kin?

14:25.790 --> 14:26.750
Yan!

14:26.960 --> 14:27.600
Dad,

14:28.840 --> 14:30.320
don't you always ask me

14:32.360 --> 14:33.910
what I see in Xiaowu?

14:35.260 --> 14:37.190
♪ We're fully committed ♪

14:37.730 --> 14:39.710
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

14:38.030 --> 14:39.600
I can give you an answer now.

14:40.930 --> 14:44.570
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

14:45.030 --> 14:47.410
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

14:48.200 --> 14:50.100
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

14:50.240 --> 14:51.200
Some people

14:51.350 --> 14:55.470
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

14:52.550 --> 14:53.950
are from humble origins,

14:55.270 --> 14:57.270
but they always honor their promises

14:57.270 --> 14:58.920
and treat others nicely.

14:57.480 --> 15:02.000
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

15:00.360 --> 15:03.440
In his last moments, Xiaowu told me not to hate you.

15:02.660 --> 15:05.150
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

15:05.660 --> 15:07.630
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

15:08.430 --> 15:10.390
♪ Time goes by ♪

15:08.720 --> 15:10.120
By contrast, some people

15:10.980 --> 15:12.820
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

15:13.150 --> 15:14.840
lead a life of luxury,

15:13.610 --> 15:17.080
♪ But our love remains still ♪

15:15.860 --> 15:18.120
but they never spend a day

15:18.150 --> 15:19.360
without scheming.

15:18.560 --> 15:22.940
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

15:19.360 --> 15:20.390
You...

15:23.690 --> 15:26.230
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

15:26.640 --> 15:28.760
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

15:29.150 --> 15:31.160
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

15:31.690 --> 15:33.610
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

15:34.240 --> 15:37.480
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

15:57.360 --> 15:59.200
I already cut some hair off.

16:00.850 --> 16:02.200
From now on,

16:00.880 --> 16:05.270
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

16:02.220 --> 16:04.080
the Clairvoyant Yang family and I

16:05.850 --> 16:08.550
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

16:09.060 --> 16:10.810
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

16:09.790 --> 16:11.080
are no longer related.

16:11.560 --> 16:13.570
♪ Time goes by ♪

16:14.160 --> 16:16.030
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

16:16.820 --> 16:20.420
♪ But our love remains still ♪

16:21.960 --> 16:26.100
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

16:27.090 --> 16:29.580
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

16:30.280 --> 16:32.160
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

16:32.850 --> 16:34.350
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

16:35.050 --> 16:36.900
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

16:36.080 --> 16:37.640
I want some quiet time alone.

16:37.640 --> 16:41.090
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

16:42.760 --> 16:47.140
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

16:43.510 --> 16:44.870
Thank you, Huaizhu.

16:48.040 --> 16:50.430
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

16:49.360 --> 16:50.560
You gotta be careful.

16:50.940 --> 16:53.120
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

16:53.740 --> 16:55.340
♪ The past vanishes ♪

16:54.840 --> 16:57.360
Watch out for the ruthless Yiqi Alliance.

16:55.920 --> 16:57.890
♪ Like a dream and a whiff of smoke ♪

16:58.590 --> 17:02.500
♪ I hope to see you again in the next life, if there is one ♪

17:31.000 --> 17:32.400
Xiaowu,

17:33.310 --> 17:34.880
with your decease,

17:36.790 --> 17:39.070
sunshine has left my life.

17:40.070 --> 17:41.570
Can you make it snow?

17:42.000 --> 17:44.160
I've been living in the south all my life.

17:44.160 --> 17:45.920
One of my biggest wishes

17:47.160 --> 17:49.200
is to watch a heavy snow.

17:50.400 --> 17:52.110
Xiaowu passed away

17:52.680 --> 17:54.200
before he could

17:54.750 --> 17:56.790
see snow.

18:08.510 --> 18:10.270
I'll make it

18:11.350 --> 18:12.350
snow

18:13.790 --> 18:16.030
for you now, Xiaowu.

18:28.310 --> 18:29.370
Thank you, Xiaowu.

18:53.590 --> 18:54.310
Chu Jing!

18:54.310 --> 18:55.370
What are you doing?

20:57.450 --> 21:02.720
[Five Rules]

21:04.830 --> 21:06.240
Dongfang Huaizhu,

21:07.110 --> 21:10.130
you betrayed the Nangong family

21:10.240 --> 21:12.500
and sided with Wangquan Hongye instead.

21:12.550 --> 21:15.150
But it doesn't mean you can always get your way.

21:21.590 --> 21:22.920
I'm right here now.

21:23.720 --> 21:25.510
Do you dare to have

21:25.830 --> 21:27.360
a one-on-one fight with me?

21:27.550 --> 21:29.720
Why would I do that?

21:29.880 --> 21:32.550
I purged Yiqi Alliance of those close to demons.

21:32.550 --> 21:33.990
Did I do anything wrong?

21:34.160 --> 21:35.690
You made demons kill humans

21:35.750 --> 21:37.960
under the influence of demon-controlling talismans.

21:37.960 --> 21:40.000
Wangquan Hongye and I are both witnesses.

21:40.000 --> 21:42.340
That's a false accusation!

21:42.510 --> 21:44.750
The crime was committed by Director Li.

21:45.440 --> 21:46.920
Who knows if the Wangquan family

21:46.920 --> 21:49.070
has instructed him to

21:49.920 --> 21:51.790
frame me?

21:52.880 --> 21:55.210
Do the five rules of the Inspection Bureau

21:56.720 --> 21:58.440
mean nothing

21:59.730 --> 22:01.490
to you people?

22:25.680 --> 22:29.000
So what if I bought all these

22:29.030 --> 22:30.510
demon-controlling

22:30.510 --> 22:31.830
talismans?

22:33.030 --> 22:34.440
Wangquan Hongye,

22:35.830 --> 22:38.070
drop the act, you phony.

22:38.440 --> 22:40.480
Your opposition to these talismans

22:41.030 --> 22:42.310
is nothing but

22:42.920 --> 22:45.390
a protest against

22:45.510 --> 22:47.160
the Nangong family.

22:48.680 --> 22:50.610
How is it justifiable to sacrifice

22:50.640 --> 22:52.200
innocent demons and humans

22:52.780 --> 22:55.110
like Chu Jing and Xiaowu

22:56.020 --> 22:58.020
for the meaningless power struggle

22:58.050 --> 22:59.510
among the noble families?

23:14.440 --> 23:16.640
The first rule of the Inspection Bureau

23:17.200 --> 23:18.530
is that the arrested

23:19.350 --> 23:20.750
must not be killed

23:21.030 --> 23:22.830
before proper interrogations.

23:24.110 --> 23:25.440
Young Master Wangquan,

23:26.000 --> 23:28.110
there is physical evidence and witnesses.

23:28.110 --> 23:29.070
Will Yiqi Alliance

23:29.070 --> 23:31.720
serve justice to Mu Xiaowu and Chu Jing?

23:32.750 --> 23:33.310
Yes.

23:36.750 --> 23:38.350
Besides, if you don't handle

23:39.750 --> 23:41.010
the matter concerning

23:42.080 --> 23:43.430
said talismans, I will.

23:47.440 --> 23:48.300
I'll handle it.

23:55.730 --> 24:04.570
[Clairvoyant Yang Residence]

23:56.540 --> 23:57.680
Huaizhu,

23:57.960 --> 24:00.550
the Inspection Bureau caused Mu Xiaowu's death.

24:00.550 --> 24:02.560
That was not your fault.

24:03.030 --> 24:05.160
Didn't Young Master Wangquan promise

24:05.510 --> 24:07.920
to exonerate and avenge Mu Xiaowu?

24:10.750 --> 24:11.830
In every aspect,

24:12.590 --> 24:13.720
I owe him a thank you

24:14.550 --> 24:15.950
for what happened today.

24:18.920 --> 24:19.710
Qinlan,

24:20.440 --> 24:21.500
I'll be right back.

24:22.640 --> 24:26.360
[Clairvoyant Yang Residence]

24:23.960 --> 24:24.510
Huaizhu.

24:26.450 --> 24:31.850
[Congratulations]

24:27.350 --> 24:28.160
Young Master,

24:29.310 --> 24:31.640
I already lost my only daughter.

24:32.200 --> 24:33.800
I've paid a high enough price

24:35.000 --> 24:37.510
for the mistake I made.

24:38.830 --> 24:40.350
I hope the Wangquan family

24:40.790 --> 24:42.240
can show me some mercy.

24:45.510 --> 24:46.440
You

24:47.640 --> 24:49.200
colluded with the evil

24:50.960 --> 24:52.220
to obtain selfish gain

24:52.790 --> 24:54.320
for yourself and your clan.

24:55.200 --> 24:57.800
You did nothing when innocent lives perished.

24:57.920 --> 25:00.590
How dare you ask for mercy?

25:00.830 --> 25:02.750
I came here because I knew Nangong Chui

25:02.750 --> 25:04.920
would use Mu Xiaowu to cook up a scheme.

25:05.790 --> 25:07.070
If you could tough it through tonight,

25:07.070 --> 25:08.920
Mu Xiaowu wouldn't have died,

25:09.240 --> 25:11.350
and I could've removed all the evil officers

25:11.350 --> 25:12.950
from the Inspection Bureau.

25:14.510 --> 25:15.510
Young Master,

25:16.590 --> 25:18.160
I'm old.

25:18.590 --> 25:20.510
My life is coming to an end.

25:21.440 --> 25:24.310
Yitan is my only hope.

25:25.640 --> 25:27.500
What happened today was my fault.

25:28.310 --> 25:29.960
To beg your forgiveness,

25:29.960 --> 25:32.400
I'll prostrate myself on the floor!

25:33.400 --> 25:34.160
Enough.

25:37.030 --> 25:37.890
This is enough.

25:46.440 --> 25:47.240
Master Yang,

25:48.960 --> 25:50.070
listen carefully.

25:52.790 --> 25:54.310
If you ever do wrong again,

25:55.830 --> 25:57.640
I'll bring you to justice

25:59.350 --> 26:01.240
without leniency.

26:43.440 --> 26:44.570
When did you arrive?

26:46.440 --> 26:48.700
When you said you could've used Mu Xiaowu

26:49.590 --> 26:51.680
to purge the Inspection Bureau.

26:54.640 --> 26:55.840
Protecting Mu Xiaowu

26:57.030 --> 26:58.430
was merely part of a ploy.

27:00.190 --> 27:02.190
What an orchestrated plan of yours,

27:02.750 --> 27:04.080
Young Master Wangquan.

27:09.160 --> 27:10.550
I was wrong.

27:12.270 --> 27:13.240
I forgot

27:14.000 --> 27:16.640
that noble families are used to plotting.

27:17.920 --> 27:20.590
Others' lives barely mean anything

27:22.030 --> 27:23.510
to people of your kind.

27:27.550 --> 27:29.830
It was foolish of me to try to help

27:30.920 --> 27:32.470
Yan in this way.

27:35.050 --> 27:37.710
If the Yang family hadn't handed over Mu Xiaowu,

27:38.110 --> 27:39.720
things would've proceeded differently.

27:39.720 --> 27:40.850
But what was the end?

27:42.640 --> 27:44.000
Mu Xiaowu died.

27:44.790 --> 27:46.030
Chu Jing died.

27:47.920 --> 27:49.550
Yan will never be

27:51.310 --> 27:52.790
happy again.

27:59.350 --> 28:01.150
I belong to the Wangquan family.

28:02.920 --> 28:04.510
I have my duties to fulfill.

28:07.790 --> 28:08.750
I cannot fail.

28:16.400 --> 28:17.730
Young Master Wangquan,

28:20.030 --> 28:21.240
do you remember

28:22.550 --> 28:24.070
your promise to Chu Jing?

28:25.030 --> 28:27.030
You don't have to go back to the mine.

28:27.310 --> 28:28.790
I will protect

28:29.200 --> 28:30.580
Xiaowu for you.

28:33.790 --> 28:34.790
Is it true?

28:35.110 --> 28:36.070
You have my word.

28:37.570 --> 28:39.050
Perhaps in Chu Jing's life,

28:39.050 --> 28:41.510
not many people would promise him anything.

28:42.000 --> 28:43.930
That's why he held firmly onto you.

28:45.590 --> 28:46.720
I thought

28:47.510 --> 28:50.160
you were an exception in the Wangquan family

28:51.240 --> 28:52.680
But I was too naive.

28:57.270 --> 28:58.600
Young Master Wangquan,

28:59.400 --> 29:00.590
I bid you farewell.

29:01.080 --> 29:02.550
I hope not to see you again.

29:33.440 --> 29:35.770
The stone tablet in the Inspection Bureau

29:37.240 --> 29:39.070
says its duty is to

29:40.510 --> 29:42.510
punish the evil and praise the good.

29:43.830 --> 29:45.350
That is a rule imposed

29:46.110 --> 29:47.830
on Yiqi Alliance.

29:49.270 --> 29:51.350
Power must not be abused.

29:53.030 --> 29:55.030
Integrity must not be compromised.

29:56.510 --> 29:59.170
To end the conflicts between demons and humans,

29:59.270 --> 30:01.070
the first thing to do is to change

30:01.240 --> 30:02.700
the entire Yiqi Alliance.

30:04.270 --> 30:06.000
Purging the Inspection Bureau

30:07.830 --> 30:09.510
is a necessary move.

30:11.000 --> 30:11.750
Yitan,

30:13.030 --> 30:14.110
I've done

30:16.200 --> 30:17.590
the right thing.

30:20.200 --> 30:21.160
But why

30:24.920 --> 30:26.510
am I so upset?

30:33.440 --> 30:34.960
You've done your best.

30:36.260 --> 30:37.420
I am the one to blame

30:38.160 --> 30:40.420
for dropping the ball on the Yang family.

30:42.350 --> 30:43.760
In this world,

30:47.590 --> 30:49.650
how many souls could be like Mu Xiaowu

30:51.680 --> 30:52.790
and Chu Jing?

31:12.880 --> 31:13.960
Why do righteous

31:15.400 --> 31:17.860
and honorable humans and demons have to die,

31:21.160 --> 31:23.750
while filthy noble families get to live?

31:27.860 --> 31:29.590
We are already

31:33.000 --> 31:35.720
in the darkest and the most chaotic times.

31:41.400 --> 31:42.270
Will we be able

31:46.960 --> 31:48.640
to eradicate evil?

31:51.790 --> 31:53.160
Is it worth these

31:56.110 --> 31:57.590
many sacrifices?

32:29.440 --> 32:30.400
You're back.

32:33.350 --> 32:34.750
You haven't

32:35.000 --> 32:36.550
eaten anything, right?

32:37.200 --> 32:38.550
I've made some noodles.

32:40.880 --> 32:41.410
Let's go.

32:53.890 --> 32:54.890
I'm not hungry.

32:58.160 --> 32:59.710
I know what happened

33:00.530 --> 33:01.590
to the Yang family.

33:03.530 --> 33:06.370
Resentful and upset though you are,

33:07.750 --> 33:08.920
your life

33:09.510 --> 33:12.030
has to go on.

33:15.960 --> 33:17.550
There's a thing I need to do.

33:19.070 --> 33:20.130
I have to go out now.

33:21.590 --> 33:22.070
Huaizhu...

33:22.070 --> 33:22.720
Qinlan,

33:23.390 --> 33:24.570
leave her alone.

33:31.640 --> 33:34.720
Every big deal in the past

33:35.960 --> 33:38.440
will seem trivial in retrospect.

33:39.160 --> 33:40.000
It's all fine.

33:40.310 --> 33:41.200
She'll move on.

33:45.070 --> 33:46.240
Come on.

33:47.270 --> 33:48.680
Eat it while it's hot.

34:03.350 --> 34:04.880
The veil dress...

34:07.310 --> 34:08.909
Ruyi Pavilion is closed now.

34:09.070 --> 34:10.400
Please come back tomorrow.

34:10.400 --> 34:11.929
I'm not here to buy jewelry.

34:17.030 --> 34:18.030
You may leave now.

34:23.800 --> 34:25.550
Miss Qingmu, I'd like to buy

34:25.570 --> 34:27.100
some information from you.

34:29.070 --> 34:30.920
Yang Yan cut off her hair today

34:31.320 --> 34:33.250
to sever ties with the Yang family.

34:34.000 --> 34:35.110
Miss Huaizhu,

34:35.230 --> 34:37.110
are you going to inquire about her?

34:37.110 --> 34:38.000
Yes.

34:38.670 --> 34:39.590
I'd like to know

34:39.960 --> 34:41.159
where Yang Yan is now.

34:41.320 --> 34:42.800
Name a price, please.

34:43.630 --> 34:45.429
You're a caring person.

34:45.590 --> 34:47.960
I won't charge you a penny this time.

34:48.610 --> 34:49.630
I will give you

34:50.000 --> 34:51.280
a satisfactory answer

34:51.280 --> 34:52.510
in seven days.

34:53.760 --> 34:54.630
Got it.

34:56.070 --> 34:56.670
Thank you.

35:03.110 --> 35:04.070
I don't know

35:04.550 --> 35:05.760
if you

35:06.070 --> 35:08.130
and Young Master Wangquan are close.

35:09.070 --> 35:10.590
I just hope you'll keep

35:10.920 --> 35:12.280
this matter secret.

35:13.720 --> 35:15.100
No one else will know about it.

35:15.100 --> 35:16.270
You have my word.

35:16.680 --> 35:17.880
This matter will not

35:18.110 --> 35:20.170
reach Young Master Wangquan's ears.

35:28.960 --> 35:31.190
Yesterday's Yiqi Alliance convention decided

35:31.190 --> 35:34.000
that the noble families would take turns
to manage the Inspection Bureau.

35:34.000 --> 35:35.760
Master Zhang Zheng abstained,

35:35.760 --> 35:36.880
but all the other families

35:36.880 --> 35:38.800
agreed to the new protocol.

35:40.840 --> 35:42.970
Is Nangong Chui in Huntian Prison now?

35:43.550 --> 35:45.630
He was put behind bars
after yesterday's convention.

35:45.630 --> 35:47.550
Given the solid proof of him instructing Director Li

35:47.550 --> 35:48.550
to manipulate demons to kill humans,

35:48.550 --> 35:49.610
he cannot get away.

35:50.400 --> 35:53.030
He slaughtered the families of those imprisoned bad demons.

35:53.030 --> 35:54.150
It is time

35:54.400 --> 35:56.000
for their feuds to be ended.

35:56.360 --> 35:57.510
Got it.

36:07.280 --> 36:07.760
You...

36:07.780 --> 36:08.510
Get in there!

36:13.510 --> 36:14.150
You...

36:14.190 --> 36:15.520
What do you want from me?

36:16.190 --> 36:17.670
Wangquan Hongye!

36:17.840 --> 36:18.840
Wangquan Hongye!

36:33.840 --> 36:37.190
Isn't this Mr. Nangong Chui, the famous demon slayer?

36:41.400 --> 36:42.550
You're right.

36:42.800 --> 36:43.960
It's him.

36:44.590 --> 36:46.360
It was he who took

36:46.550 --> 36:48.850
my daughter's demon core

36:49.230 --> 36:51.710
and offered it to Nangong Ye.

36:59.030 --> 37:00.360
What are you going to do?

37:09.880 --> 37:11.250
Who are you?

37:11.360 --> 37:12.690
What are you going to do?

37:13.360 --> 37:14.360
I'm telling you,

37:15.440 --> 37:17.110
they've put me in the wrong place.

37:17.110 --> 37:19.110
I-I-I shouldn't be here.

37:19.690 --> 37:20.880
Get away from me.

37:21.150 --> 37:22.790
Obnoxious demons,

37:23.230 --> 37:24.230
stay away from me!

37:28.670 --> 37:29.670
Stay away from me.

37:33.150 --> 37:34.400
You... You demons...

37:35.000 --> 37:35.800
You...
